{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>將軍澳今日（22日）發生有人暈倒事故。下午3時46分，警方接獲坑口道一間院舍職員報案，指一名18歲姓黎男院友，在房間懷疑暈倒。救護人員接報到場，事主仍然陷入昏迷，由救護車送往將軍澳醫院治理。警方正調查事發原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送往將軍澳醫院調查。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400694740422656719852.jpeg/36XIbZW10GMGtqYGFJi4xxS8gZIq8TSa-apORdyqTkU\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送往將軍澳醫院調查。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:02:12.316305+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:47:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:18:31.775727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:05.786174+00:00","content_hash":"3132d7e9bcdcec24517a52e7adb5dc1dce499f40840d2dc905ba46c13aa61bbc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}